&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Coordinate and execute ASO initiatives, including metadata updates, creative experiments and app store events, in collaboration with Product Marketing and our external agency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Translate approved lifecycle campaign briefs into executable plans and support hands-on campaign execution across key moments in the user journey.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Support the execution of product launches and other priority growth initiatives by coordinating workstreams, cross-functional handoffs and operational follow-through.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
