&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Serve internal teams (Smart Window, New Products) and outside tools through one shared layer.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
